00:48:42,352 --> 00:48:48,352
Justin Louis Baldoni (born January 24, 1984) is an American actor and director.

10
00:54:07,058 --> 00:54:13,058
He is best known for playing Rafael Solano on the CW telenovela Jane the Virgin (2014–2019) and
for starring in and directing the romantic drama film It Ends with Us (2024).

11
00:59:31,764 --> 00:59:37,764
He has also directed Five Feet Apart (2019) and Clouds (2020).

12
01:04:56,470 --> 01:05:02,470
Baldoni co-founded the production company Wayfarer Studios in 2019.

13
01:10:21,176 --> 01:10:27,176
Through his company he has produced and co-hosted the Man Enough podcast.

14
01:15:45,882 --> 01:15:51,882
He has also published two books on exploring positive masculinity
and overcoming societal expectations of being a man.

15
01:21:10,588 --> 01:21:16,588
He is also currently involved in litigation after Blake Lively, who co-starred
with him in It Ends with Us, accused him of sexual harassment.

16
01:26:35,294 --> 01:26:41,294
The tone is emotional.
